          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Namani aramubarira, ati K’utavyemeye, ndasavye ni bampe ivu ryotwarwa n’inyumbu zibiri, kuk’ uhereye none ata kimazi nzokwosereza izindi mana canke ngo ndazihe ikindi kimazi ic’ ari co cose, atar’ Uhoraho wenyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.7.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abam 7:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.7.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arik’ Uhoraho az’ ampangaze jewe umusavyi wawe kur’ iki kimwe: databuja iyo yinjiye mu ngoro ya Rimoni kuyisenga, ari jewe ndamushigikiye, maze nkunama mur’ iyo ngoro ya Rimoni; iyo nunamye mur’ iyo ngoro, Uhoraho az’ ampangaze kur’ ico kintu, jewe umusavyi wawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisa aramubarira, ati Genda amahoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Namani avuyeyo, agenze akarēre gatoya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.4.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abam 4:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gehazi, umusuku w’uwo muntu w’Imana Elisa, arivuganya, ati Databuja ko yahebeye Namani uwo Musiriya, ntiyābīre ivyo amugemuye, ndahiye uguhoraho kw’Uhoraho, singenda ntirutse ngo ndamuhamvye, ngire ico ndamwiyakira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Gehazi akurikira Namani. Maze Namani abonye ūmukurikiye yiruka, arururuka ava mu mukogote wiwe ngo bahūre. Aramubaza, ati N’amahoro? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.5.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abam 5:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na we ati N’amahoro; ati Databuja arantumye, ng’ Ubu nyene agendewe n’abahungu babiri bo mu biga ivyo kuvugishwa, baturutse mu mugamba w’Abefurayimu; ngo None mutabare, ubamuhēre italanto y’ifeza n’imyambaro ibiri yo gukūranya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Namani aramwishura, at’ Enda n’utware italanto zibiri. Nukw aramugōbēra, amutekerera italanto zibiri z’amafeza mu masaho abiri hamwe n’imyambaro ibiri yo gukūranya, abikorera abantu biwe babiri, baja imbere ya Gehazi bavyikoreye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babishikanye ku musozi w’i wabo, arabibāka, araheza abijana mu nzu arabibīka, arungika abo bantu, baragenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ araza, yinjira aho shebuja ari. Elisa aramubaza, at’ Uvuye hehe ga Gehazi? Uwundi at’ Eka nta ho nagiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aramubarira, ati Mbeg’ ugira ng’ umutima wanje ntiwajanye nawe, igihe wa mugabo yava mu mukogote wiwe agahindukira ngo muhūre? Mbeg’ iki n’igihe co kwākīra amahera n’imyambaro, n’imirima y’imyelayo n’iy’ imizabibu, n’intama n’ inka, n’abagurano n’abaguranokazi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.12.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guh 12:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None rer’ imibembe ya Namani izokwōmako no ku ruvyaro rwawe kugeza ibihe vyose. Maze Gehazi ava imbere yiwe ajejeta imibembe, yera nka shelegi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5:27",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "shelegi n’ikintu coroshe cera, gikoroka hasi nk’imvura, gikanye cane.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
